icosahedron              on pentakis dodecahedron        11*s**2 + 18*s - 9           s = -9/11 + 6*sqrt(5)/11
icosahedron              on deltoidal hexecontahedron    11*s**2 - 60*s + 45          s = 30/11 - 9*sqrt(5)/11
